cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its benchmark results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "gestalt-core: local search over Markdown notes for coding agents, with a rerunnable BEIR benchmark"
abstract: "A Markdown knowledge base for Claude Code and Cursor, searched by stella_en_400M_v5 dense vectors in SQLite with sqlite-vec, full-text BM25 as the lexical fallback and an optional Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B rerank, plus session hooks, skills, rules and an evaluation harness. The repository reports nDCG@10 on BEIR SciFact, NFCorpus and FiQA with seeded confidence intervals and paired permutation tests, and one command reproduces the table."
authors:
